    "introduction": "Lynsey was born in Canada to American parents and has lived in the UK since she was 10. She is 25% Scottish, 25% Irish and 25% English, with the remaining 25% split between Native Tlingit (Alaska) and Scandinavian. She is enrolled on the Central Council of Tlingit and Haida Indian Tribes of Alaska. Lynsey trained as an actor at Arts Ed in London and has worked extensively in theatre, television and film. She now lives in Scotland and travels widely for work and adventure.",
